-- scripts/source_greek_long_tail.sql
-- Sourcing rigor VII (v1.42.0): the Greek long tail. The last ~154 ref-only Greek
-- entities (sourced only to the Theoi index) brought to verified PRIMARY-TEXT
-- attestation, each matched to its correct ancient locus. Additive: the Theoi
-- reference is kept; this adds the cited primary passage. All entities are currently
-- ref-only, so there is no dedupe risk. Loci verified against Theoi/Perseus by
-- research pass (UNVERIFIED figures deliberately left: Lampades, Mormolykeia,
-- Eleutheria, Soter, Soteria, Kakodaimon — no clean primary locus survives).

BEGIN;

-- ── New public-domain primary texts (+ two ancient compilations) ──────────────
